(1. Problem Formulation) Tj
0 -12 Td
(The disaster management control center needs a problem-solving agent that finds an emergency) Tj
0 -12 Td
(route from a start location to a goal location during flooding in Chennai. The city map is) Tj
0 -12 Td
(represented as a graph where each node is a location and each edge is a reachable road) Tj
0 -12 Td
(segment. The agent uses Greedy Best First Search, where f\(n\) = h\(n\), so the next expanded) Tj
0 -12 Td
(node is always the frontier node with the smallest estimated distance to the goal.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
