0 -12 Td
(The environment is partially observable because the program only knows the graph and) Tj
0 -12 Td
(heuristic values provided in the input. It is deterministic for the submitted implementation) Tj
0 -12 Td
(because each action leads to the listed neighbor with a known cost. It is sequential because) Tj
0 -12 Td
(each route decision affects the following state. It is static during one search run because) Tj
0 -12 Td
